+"""TASK_907 — the live fill-model probe (D65: "(b) then (a)" — the probe runs first).
+
+Phase 1 (shadow, zero risk): `recorder.py` (capture), `capture.py` (format + gap honesty),
+`shadow_engine.py` (virtual fills + markouts), `reference_fill_model.py` (declared rule under
+test), `estimands.py`, `render.py`, `cli.py`.
+
+Phase 2 (this run: refusal + rails ONLY, no live transmission): `phase2_rails.py`.
+
+See `PREREGISTRATION.md` (written before any analysis code) and the task file
+`tasks/TASK_907_LIVE_FILL_PROBE.md`.
+"""
